# pan-backup

Back up Palo Alto Networks firewall configs. Run as a cronjob.

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
```

Edit `pan.conf` with your firewall host and API key. The file is Python;
`backup_file` is computed from today's date when the config is loaded.

## Usage

```bash
uv run pan_backup.py -c /path/to/pan.conf
```

## Test

```bash
uv run pytest
```
